# What goes in the sdist. The wheel carries only the importable package; the
# sdist adds what a reader of the source needs: the changelog, the docs and
# the example configs.
#
# The test suite is not shipped. It needs the repository (CI workflows, git,
# the e2e harness), so from an extracted sdist it could not pass, and a suite
# that fails out of the box is worse than none. Clone the repository to run it.

include CHANGELOG.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
include LICENSE
include README.md

recursive-include docs *.md
recursive-include examples *.toml *.py *.md

prune tests
prune .github
